A valid bitonic array must have exactly 3 phases in order:
Phase 1 → strictly INCREASING
Phase 2 → one PEAK
Phase 3 → strictly DECREASING
Think of it as 3 steps in code
Step 1 → walk forward while increasing
Step 2 → check if we reached a peak (not start, not end)
Step 3 → walk forward while decreasing
Step 4 → if we reached end → bitonic ✅
